# 🏥 Rural Healthcare

A web-based **Rural Healthcare Management and Assistance Platform** designed to improve access to healthcare services for people living in rural and underserved areas.

The project provides a simple and accessible interface through which users can explore healthcare-related information and services. The goal is to use technology to help bridge the gap between rural communities and essential healthcare resources.

