## ⚙️ How the Application Works

The basic workflow of the application is:

```text
User
  ↓
Rural Healthcare Website
  ↓
Navigation / Healthcare Services
  ↓
Information & Services
  ↓
User receives relevant healthcare resources
```

The current frontend acts as the user interface.

In future versions, it can communicate with a backend server and database.

A more complete architecture could be:

```text
                 ┌──────────────────┐
